   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Parts of the letter",
     "texto": [
      "The **Identitas pengirim** identifies who writes; the **alamat tujuan** indicates who the message is addressed to. In the body, present the chronology and explain what solution you expect."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Clarity and publication",
     "texto": [
      "Keep the exposition **ringkas** and **runtut**. A public letter can be **diterbitkan** so that other people learn about the matter; that is why politeness and verifiable details matter."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
